# Runs, Restore points, in-process platform stores and the index are output, not source: written by `agentdiag run`, a push and `agentdiag index rebuild`.
# Each Target's redaction.yaml is local: the names it lists are never committed.
.agentdiag/targets/*/runs/
.agentdiag/targets/*/restore-points/
.agentdiag/targets/*/platform/
.agentdiag/index.sqlite
.agentdiag/targets/*/redaction.yaml
